OL,3,CPolice increase presence after
OL,4,Creported stabbing in Sussex
OL,6,FSussex Police are appealing for
OL,7,Fwitnesses and information after a
OL,8,Freported stabbing in Worthing in the
OL,9,Fearly hours on Tuesday (11th August).
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Shelley Road
OL,12,Fat the junction with Salisbury Road
OL,13,Faround 1:10am.
OL,15,FA 37-year-old man was injured and
OL,16,Ftaken to hospital.
OL,18,FIn an appeal for more information
OL,19,FDetective Inspector Lee Simmonds
OL,20,Fissued a description of a suspect.
