OL,3,CPolice increase presence after
OL,4,Creported stabbing in Sussex
OL,6,FHe also reassured residents that an
OL,7,Fincreased police presence would be in
OL,8,Fplace while investigations continue.
OL,10,F"The suspect was described as a slim
OL,11,Fblack man wearing a brown T-shirt and
OL,12,Fjeans," said Detective Inspector Lee
OL,13,FSimmonds.
OL,15,FHe added: "There will be an increased
OL,16,Fpolice presence in the area while we
OL,17,Fcarry out enquiries and to provide
OL,18,Freassurance.
