OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786538913
OL,3,CPolice increase presence after
OL,4,Creported stabbing in Sussex
OL,6,F"We are appealing for anyone who saw
OL,7,Fwhat happened or who saw anything
OL,8,Fsuspicious in the area at the time to
OL,9,Fcome forward. This includes anyone
OL,10,Fwith CCTV, dashcam, doorbell or mobile
OL,11,Fphone footage.
OL,13,F"Information can be reported to Sussex
OL,14,FPolice online, quoting serial 76 of 11/
OL,15,F08."
